{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14855","headline":"赋得白鸥歌送李伯康归使 · 卢纶","name":"赋得白鸥歌送李伯康归使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积水深源，白鸥翻翻。\n倒影光素，于潭之间。\n衔鱼鱼落乱惊鸣，争扑莲藂莲叶倾。\n尔不见波中鸥鸟闲无营，何必汲汲劳其生。\n柳花冥蒙大堤口，悠扬相和乍无有。\n轻随去浪杳不分，细舞清风亦何有。\n似君换得白鹅时，独凭阑干雪满池。\n今日还同看鸥鸟，如何羽翮复参差。\n复参差，海涛澜漫何由期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}